Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.55,0:00:03.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}＜游马：终于开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.50,0:00:04.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}世界决斗狂欢节！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.55,0:00:07.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在心跳镇以冠军宝座为目标{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.55,0:00:09.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从全世界聚集而来的决斗者们{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.55,0:00:11.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将展开激烈的战斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.55,0:00:13.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当然 优胜是我的！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.55,0:00:15.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！一飞冲天！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.55,0:00:18.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.55,0:00:20.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谁啊？你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.55,0:00:23.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（卡凯鲁）来吧 这个球选择了你！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.55,0:00:26.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.49,0:00:28.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}话说 那是什么球啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.55,0:00:31.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙是我的搭档！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.55,0:00:34.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一边把这个球颠几万次{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.55,0:00:37.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一边总是思考着自己卡组的战略！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.55,0:00:40.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把卡放到球上？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.55,0:00:43.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赌上心之碎片，来和我一战！！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.55,0:00:45.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞～！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.55,0:00:48.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正合我意！我接受挑战！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.55,0:00:51.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是九十九游马！你呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.55,0:00:54.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}国立翔！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.55,0:00:55.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力）国立翔？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.60,0:00:56.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）你认识？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.55,0:01:00.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯～好像在哪听过……。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.55,0:01:02.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦，要开始了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.55,0:01:07.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，开球！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.55,0:01:11.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞～！一飞冲天，我！！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.55,0:01:14.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗盘，设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.55,0:01:23.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}D视镜，设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.55,0:01:27.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}AR影像，连接完成。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.55,0:01:29.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（2人）决斗！！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.55,0:01:31.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先攻就由我拿下了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.55,0:01:33.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.55,0:01:34.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我把怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.93,0:01:38.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以里侧守备表示盖放，回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.55,0:01:42.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（星光体）盖放的是 隆隆隆石人。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.55,0:01:45.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被敌人的挑衅冲昏头 不顾后果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.55,0:01:48.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把怪兽以攻击表示召唤出来了吧{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.55,0:01:50.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来你多少也成长了一点啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.55,0:01:51.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}少罗嗦！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.45,0:01:54.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别唧唧歪歪的，给我闭嘴看着！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.55,0:01:55.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.07,0:01:57.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不知道你在冲谁嚷嚷{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.55,0:01:59.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过你马上也会闭嘴的。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.55,0:02:02.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让你好好见识一下我足球卡组的实力！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.55,0:02:05.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了！我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.55,0:02:08.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动场地魔法 梦想球场！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.55,0:02:18.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（欢呼声）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.55,0:02:26.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这…这是什么鬼！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.90,0:02:36.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么情况？这是。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.55,0:02:38.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（凯西）喵…喵！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.15,0:02:39.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是喵了个咪的！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.55,0:02:42.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}突然之间 我们来到了一座巨大的足球场
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.79,0:02:44.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被扔进去了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.55,0:02:45.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说到底 这就是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.86,0:02:48.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场地魔法 梦想球场的效果！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.55,0:02:51.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（欢呼）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.55,0:02:54.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇 好厉害～！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.55,0:02:55.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还不止这样。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.57,0:02:57.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场地魔法 梦想球场是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.55,0:03:00.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将里侧守备怪兽变为表侧守备表示！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.55,0:03:01.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.14,0:03:03.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（轰轰轰轰魔像）轰 轰 轰！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.55,0:03:09.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后我从手牌召唤队长·翼！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.55,0:03:16.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（队长·翼）加油！！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.55,0:03:18.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力 １１００？对轰轰轰轰魔像
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.94,0:03:20.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种攻击 根本没用～！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.55,0:03:24.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动魔法卡 杀手传球！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.55,0:03:27.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接住！ 队长·翼！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.55,0:03:30.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 在这个回合内队长·翼{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.55,0:03:32.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与比自己守备力更高的怪兽战斗时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.55,0:03:36.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力会变成两倍！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.55,0:03:39.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管是两倍还是三倍隆隆石像怪{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.55,0:03:41.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一回合只有一次
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.04,0:03:43.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不会被战斗破坏的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.55,0:03:45.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太天真了！杀手通行证{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.55,0:03:48.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会把战斗对象的怪兽效果无效化！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.55,0:03:49.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.02,0:03:50.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！队长之翼！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.55,0:03:53.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}究极弹丸射门！！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.55,0:04:03.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咕哇啊～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.55,0:04:07.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（欢呼声）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.55,0:04:09.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔！为什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.55,0:04:11.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}守备表示的怪兽就算被打倒
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.62,0:04:13.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}生命值也不会被扣吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.55,0:04:15.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}队长之翼{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.55,0:04:17.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拥有超过守备力的会给予对手
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.55,0:04:19.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力数值的伤害效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.55,0:04:23.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶～！这家伙 说不定 真的 很强。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.96,0:05:56.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（欢呼声）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.96,0:06:01.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 盖放一张卡 回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.96,0:06:03.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}加油 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.96,0:06:05.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗 才刚刚开始呢～！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.81,0:06:06.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（三人）加油～！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.96,0:06:09.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}胜负 现在才要开始！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.40,0:06:11.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 猫步走起～！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.96,0:06:14.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说得对。 好 上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.96,0:06:16.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合。 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.96,0:06:20.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 召唤我我我魔术师！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.96,0:06:22.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（我我我魔术师）呜哦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.96,0:06:24.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 我我我魔术师！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.87,0:06:26.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}攻{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}击队长{\fnYusei Magic}・翼～！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.96,0:06:27.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好的～！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.90,0:06:30.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我我我魔术师的攻击力是 １５００！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.96,0:06:33.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}队长{\fnYusei Magic}・翼的攻{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}击{\fnYusei Magic}力
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.20,0:06:34.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经恢复原状了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.96,0:06:36.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.96,0:06:38.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.46,0:06:39.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喔喔～！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.96,0:06:41.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.16,0:06:42.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）进球！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.96,0:06:44.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太棒了～ 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.74,0:06:45.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（哨声）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.96,0:06:48.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个进球 无效。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.96,0:06:50.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎哎～ 无效！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.17,0:06:50.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为喵啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.96,0:06:52.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是陷阱卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.71,0:06:53.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.96,0:06:55.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 我 发动了陷阱卡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.96,0:06:57.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}越位陷阱。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.96,0:06:59.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}越位！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.96,0:07:02.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡的效果是 自己场上的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.78,0:07:03.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被破坏的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.96,0:07:05.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将那只怪兽的破坏和伤害无效化{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.96,0:07:07.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}强制结束回合。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.96,0:07:10.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}强……强制结束！？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.96,0:07:12.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会这样～。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.96,0:07:14.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}观察结果 其15。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.96,0:07:17.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}足球这东西似乎相当深奥。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.96,0:07:20.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不对 现在不是佩服的时候！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.96,0:07:24.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好了 差不多该动真格了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.31,0:07:24.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.96,0:07:26.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合！抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.96,0:07:29.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤前锋·托普！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.96,0:07:33.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（前锋·托普）哼！嘿～！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.96,0:07:36.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不用解放就召唤出等级5的怪兽！？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.96,0:07:38.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这不可能吧 那种事！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.96,0:07:39.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场地魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.81,0:07:41.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}梦想球场发动的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.96,0:07:44.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}前锋·托普可以不用解放就召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.96,0:07:46.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}骗人的吧～！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.96,0:07:49.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊～ 前锋·托普！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.96,0:07:51.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击嘎嘎嘎魔术师！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.96,0:07:53.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.55,0:07:54.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.96,0:07:56.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.96,0:07:59.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来，球门前就空无一人了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.96,0:08:01.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}冲进去，队长之翼！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.96,0:08:02.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直接攻击，拿下吧～！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.95,0:08:03.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿呀～！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.31,0:08:07.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～！唔哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.96,0:08:09.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（欢呼声）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.96,0:08:11.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.96,0:08:13.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的，看不下去了喵。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.96,0:08:15.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼，还早着呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.96,0:08:18.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动魔法卡，眼神交流！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.96,0:08:21.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}它的效果是将墓地里的越位陷阱{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.96,0:08:23.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回到手牌！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.96,0:08:27.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放一张卡，回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.96,0:08:29.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么办啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.01,0:08:31.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是又被他用越位陷阱{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.96,0:08:33.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又会让任何攻击都无效化{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.96,0:08:38.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合也 强制结束！ 唔！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.96,0:08:40.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}话说 你在睡什么啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.58,0:08:41.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我并没有在睡。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.96,0:08:45.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我只是在回忆足球这东西罢了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.96,0:08:48.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的 真靠不住啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.96,0:08:51.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊～ 该怎么办才好啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.96,0:08:53.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再怎么想 都是白费。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.31,0:08:55.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的足球卡组 没有死角！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.96,0:08:57.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说你 毫无胜算！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.96,0:08:59.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 快看那个！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.81,0:09:00.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的假的！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.96,0:09:03.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 可是超级粉丝啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.40,0:09:03.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.96,0:09:04.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.90,0:09:05.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是…！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.96,0:09:08.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力）足球国家队的正选
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.20,0:09:09.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}兄弟前锋 卡兹和希德！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.96,0:09:11.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（凯茜）怎么 会在这里！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.96,0:09:14.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力）这样啊我想起来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.96,0:09:16.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}国立翔……他归根结底{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.96,0:09:21.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是卡兹和秀的弟弟！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.96,0:09:25.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错以那彻底的团队配合闻名{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.96,0:09:30.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}世界级名帅 国立茂教练的第三个儿子啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.96,0:09:33.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的假的！？你居然是那个有名的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.31,0:09:34.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}足球一家的老幺！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.96,0:09:36.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那又怎样！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.96,0:09:38.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我跟老爸和哥哥们没关系！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.96,0:09:40.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么团队配合啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.96,0:09:42.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被别人拖后腿这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.63,0:09:43.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我已经受够了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.96,0:09:45.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以我选择了决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.96,0:09:48.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗是1对1的胜负！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.96,0:09:50.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}站上场地能相信的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.85,0:09:51.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只有自己！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.96,0:09:54.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好好看着！我凭自己的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.33,0:09:56.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一定会成为决斗冠军给你看。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.96,0:09:59.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那可不对啊，翔！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.96,0:10:02.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗也是团队配合！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.40,0:10:03.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}团队配合！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.96,0:10:05.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算是现在，你也不是一个人。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.96,0:10:07.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你不是正和同伴一起战斗吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.96,0:10:09.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}同伴！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.14,0:10:09.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.96,0:10:12.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}队长之翼和前锋之顶。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.96,0:10:16.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那些怪兽也是你的同伴吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.96,0:10:19.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一直都相信着自己的怪兽在战斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.96,0:10:22.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我和怪兽是一个团队。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.96,0:10:26.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}团队……！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.96,0:10:28.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，游马，我们的回合了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.96,0:10:32.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦，等等你想起足球的事了吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.96,0:10:34.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊，还有游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.96,0:10:37.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多亏了你我想出了一步好棋，要赢哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.96,0:10:45.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们可不能在这种地方输掉。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.96,0:10:48.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是当然！好，上吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.96,0:10:50.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.96,0:10:52.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.00,0:10:54.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}召唤兹巴巴巴斯特！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.96,0:10:58.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是我来召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.96,0:11:01.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤兹巴巴巴斯特！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.96,0:11:09.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后使用魔法卡死者苏生
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.75,0:11:11.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤隆隆隆石人！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.96,0:11:14.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？召唤隆隆隆石人！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.96,0:11:17.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是团队配合，游马，相信我。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.96,0:11:20.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，知道了！我再
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.30,0:11:22.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动魔法卡死者苏生。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.96,0:11:26.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从墓地把隆隆隆石人以守备表示特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.96,0:11:29.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼，不管你召唤出什么样的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.96,0:11:32.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}越位陷阱是绝对无法攻破的。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.96,0:11:35.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且，要是那玩意再发动的话……。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.31,0:11:36.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}交叉攻击，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.96,0:11:37.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.44,0:11:39.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从手牌发动魔法卡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.70,0:11:41.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}交叉攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.96,0:11:43.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.96,0:11:46.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动魔法卡，交叉攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.96,0:11:50.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在场上存在攻击力相同的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.10,0:11:51.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}两只怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.96,0:11:54.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以直接攻击对方玩家。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.96,0:11:59.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.96,0:12:05.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从……进球了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.96,0:12:09.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太好了～第一次进球耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.96,0:12:11.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成功了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.02,0:12:12.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马队，这次终于{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.96,0:12:14.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}削减了卡凯路的生命值。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.96,0:12:18.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶，越位陷阱无法对直接攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.41,0:12:20.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动，被他们察觉到了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.96,0:12:23.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没结束呢兹巴巴巴斯特的攻击{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.96,0:12:25.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当对方受到伤害时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.96,0:12:28.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场上攻击力最低的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.06,0:12:29.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽也会被破坏。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.96,0:12:33.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用这个效果时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.96,0:12:35.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}兹巴巴巴斯特的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.39,0:12:36.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会下降８００点，但{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.96,0:12:39.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能干掉１只怪兽是有意义的。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.96,0:12:41.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张也能用！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.51,0:12:44.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我再发动速攻魔法 追加分！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.96,0:12:48.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在用效果破坏怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.96,0:12:50.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予对方５００点伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.96,0:12:54.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}终于同分了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.46,0:12:55.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}追上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.96,0:12:58.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太棒了～ 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.96,0:13:02.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看到了吗 这就是我的团队配合。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.96,0:13:05.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖１张卡 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.96,0:13:09.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别太得意了 九十九游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.96,0:13:11.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}队长翼不过是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.03,0:13:13.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说到底 攻击力1100的废柴怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.31,0:13:15.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种没用的卡就算被破坏了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.96,0:13:18.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你 还在说那种话吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.96,0:13:20.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连自己的怪兽…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.35,0:13:22.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连同伴都不相信 那怎么行啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.96,0:13:25.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没用的家伙根本算不上同伴！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.96,0:13:30.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}传这边！ 快转过来！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.96,0:13:33.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在干什么啊 真是的 真没用。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.96,0:13:36.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赶紧把球传给我！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.96,0:13:39.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（卡兹）那家伙…。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.96,0:13:42.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《可恶 我一个人…》
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.96,0:13:44.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这边！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.96,0:13:48.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}卡凯尔 这边 传球！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.96,0:13:51.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《哼 你们这些家伙怎么能信
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.28,0:13:52.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一个人来决胜负！》
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.96,0:13:59.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（哨声）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.96,0:14:02.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙就是和人和秀的弟弟？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.96,0:14:05.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}跟哥哥们差得也太远了吧……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.32,0:14:05.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.96,0:14:07.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}听说他脚受过伤{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.96,0:14:09.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}该不会从一开始就很菜吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.96,0:14:11.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（笑声）
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.96,0:14:14.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没事吧，翔！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.96,0:14:15.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吵死了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.78,0:14:17.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都怪你们盯人太松了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.96,0:14:19.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的，一点用都没有！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.96,0:14:21.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（秀）没用的家伙是你！翔！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.96,0:14:23.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}足球可不是一个人踢的！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.96,0:14:28.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是连这个都不懂现在就给我滚出场地！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.96,0:14:31.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《从那天起我就抛弃了足球。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.96,0:14:34.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后我发誓。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.96,0:14:39.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总有一天要让那些老哥刮目相看……》
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.96,0:14:42.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而作为那个手段我选择了决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.96,0:14:45.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果是决斗的话 一个人就能成为世界第一！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.96,0:14:48.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}坦率一点吧 翔。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.96,0:14:50.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}其实 你也是心里清楚的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.96,0:14:53.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不然的话那么强的足球卡组{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.96,0:14:55.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根本不可能组得出来啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.96,0:14:58.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙就是 你的全明星队伍啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.96,0:15:01.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}翔…… 你是真的 喜欢足球啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.96,0:15:03.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…… 闭嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.20,0:15:04.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 对足球什么的！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.96,0:15:07.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有什么不好嘛喜欢就是喜欢！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.96,0:15:09.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也 喜欢决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.96,0:15:13.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以 我要和同伴一起战斗到最后！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.96,0:15:17.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}同伴… 团队…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.96,0:15:20.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我…对你们…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.96,0:15:23.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.96,0:15:26.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合！ 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.31,0:15:28.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我… 相信！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.74,0:15:29.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.96,0:15:32.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌召唤 后卫自由人！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.96,0:15:36.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（卡凯尔）这只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.59,0:15:38.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当场上 有梦想球场时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.96,0:15:40.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级 上升１！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.96,0:15:43.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 我发动魔法卡 团队合作！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.96,0:15:44.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.52,0:15:45.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这不是好好带着嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.96,0:15:47.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是这种 卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.19,0:15:48.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在可不是高兴的时候。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.96,0:15:50.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那张魔法卡的效果是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.96,0:15:52.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己场上有同种族
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.98,0:15:55.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}同等级的怪兽2只时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.96,0:15:57.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从墓地选同种族的怪兽1只{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.96,0:15:59.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.26,0:15:59.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.96,0:16:02.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要召唤回来的是 队长·翼！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.96,0:16:04.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦～嘞！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.46,0:16:05.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（欢呼）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.96,0:16:09.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用这个效果特殊召唤的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.83,0:16:11.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽等级上升1。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.96,0:16:16.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 等级5的怪兽就有3只了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.15,0:16:16.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.96,0:16:19.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将 等级5的前锋·托普和
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.33,0:16:20.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}后卫·自由人以及{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.96,0:16:23.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}队长·翼 进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.96,0:16:25.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用3只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.43,0:16:27.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.96,0:16:29.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.96,0:16:32.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}该你出场了 中场大师·十号！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.96,0:16:36.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（中场大师·十号）上啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.96,0:16:38.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（欢呼声）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.96,0:16:41.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力 2600！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.96,0:16:44.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是挨了这一击 到头来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.23,0:16:45.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根本扛不住啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.96,0:16:47.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！攻击兹巴巴巴斯特！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.96,0:16:49.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 是陷阱卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.96,0:16:52.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我以兹巴巴巴斯特为对象{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.96,0:16:55.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动陷阱卡 半不破！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.96,0:17:01.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根据这个效果兹巴巴巴斯特不会被破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.96,0:17:04.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（卡凯尔）哦～咧哦咧 抽射！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.45,0:17:04.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗒～！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.96,0:17:06.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（兹巴巴巴斯特）兹巴兹巴～。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.96,0:17:08.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咕哇…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.96,0:17:11.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 根据半不破的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.96,0:17:13.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对玩家造成的伤害减半！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.96,0:17:16.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哪怕削减自己的生命值
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.50,0:17:19.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也要保护怪兽… 保护同伴吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.96,0:17:21.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 还没结束呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.96,0:17:24.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动幻想师的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.96,0:17:26.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}消耗一个超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.96,0:17:28.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能对对方攻击力最高的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.96,0:17:31.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再攻击一次！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.96,0:17:36.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}轰轰轰魔像 一回合只有一次。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.96,0:17:38.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不会被战斗破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.37,0:17:38.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗒啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.96,0:17:47.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}第二次 你防不住了吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.96,0:17:50.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嚯！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.96,0:17:52.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗒啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.96,0:17:56.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.70,0:17:59.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用掉最后的超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.96,0:18:01.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动第三次攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.96,0:18:04.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}剩下的就是 兹巴巴巴斯特！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.96,0:18:07.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 幻想家！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.10,0:18:09.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看我的 驱动射门！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.96,0:18:12.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}半安布雷克的效果也还留着呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.96,0:18:14.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}兹巴兹巴…。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.96,0:18:17.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.96,0:18:19.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.96,0:18:21.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼……算你捡回一条命。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.96,0:18:24.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过你只剩100点生命值了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.00,0:18:25.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下个回合就跟你做个了断。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.96,0:18:27.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.96,0:18:29.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别担心，小鸟。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.96,0:18:32.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能和这么强的对手交手{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.96,0:18:35.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然最棒了，决斗嘉年华！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.96,0:18:37.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你还有心思觉得自己能赢？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.96,0:18:40.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我手里可还留着
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.36,0:18:41.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}越位陷阱呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.96,0:18:44.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能赢的。因为我到最后都相信着同伴！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.96,0:18:50.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了，我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.96,0:18:53.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤我我我女孩！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.96,0:19:03.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力1000？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.84,0:19:06.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算你召唤出这种怪兽……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.96,0:19:09.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不，这样一来等级3就……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.96,0:19:10.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊，游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.88,0:19:12.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}召唤新的超量怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.96,0:19:15.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！我把等级3的刷啦啦巴士和{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.96,0:19:19.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我我我女孩叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.96,0:19:21.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.43,0:19:23.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.96,0:19:25.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.96,0:19:29.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧！流浪的吉他手！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.96,0:19:31.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是我的新伙伴……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.96,0:19:34.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}痒痒节奏！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.96,0:19:40.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（痒痒节奏）痒。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.96,0:19:44.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后我发动装备魔法巨人杀手！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.96,0:19:47.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备给痒痒节奏！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.96,0:19:49.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}由于这张卡的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.66,0:19:52.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方玩家在战斗阶段结束时之前{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.96,0:19:56.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}魔法、陷阱卡无法发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.96,0:19:58.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了！这样一来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.15,0:19:59.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}越位陷阱就用不了了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.96,0:20:02.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再加上 装备了巨人杀手
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.28,0:20:03.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽攻击的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.96,0:20:05.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己的生命值比对方低的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.96,0:20:09.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以把对方怪兽的攻击力减半！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.96,0:20:10.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力减半！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.96,0:20:14.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后我发动 痒痒旋律的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.96,0:20:17.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用1个叠放单位
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.07,0:20:19.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与对方的怪兽超量怪兽战斗时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.96,0:20:22.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力可以变成2倍！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.96,0:20:24.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊 痒痒旋律！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.96,0:20:33.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.96,0:20:41.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进球！ 游马队在最后关头上演大逆转！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.96,0:20:43.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.96,0:20:46.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马赢了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.96,0:20:49.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赢了 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.17,0:20:49.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.96,0:20:52.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的力量也不过稍微借来用了下。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.96,0:21:03.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵…啊哈哈…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.96,0:21:05.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你、你…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.14,0:21:06.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是多久以来了呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.96,0:21:09.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这么沉迷地踢足球。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.96,0:21:12.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然足球就是开心啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.18,0:21:13.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不，足球什么的…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.96,0:21:15.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿嘿…是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.96,0:21:17.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（驱）嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.96,0:21:19.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我果然还是喜欢足球。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.96,0:21:23.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多亏了你我才醒悟过来。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.96,0:21:27.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然这么想就再回来吧，驱。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.96,0:21:29.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回到我们的场地。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.96,0:21:30.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.63,0:21:31.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在的你的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.96,0:21:34.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那时候我们说过的话
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.05,0:21:35.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}应该能坦率地听进去了吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.96,0:21:37.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那时候的话…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.96,0:21:40.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}足球啊可不是一个人踢的。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.96,0:21:45.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太好了，翔。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.48,0:21:45.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.96,0:21:48.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也要快点为了能追上哥哥们{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.96,0:21:51.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}认真地努力踢足球。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.21,0:21:51.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也要{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.96,0:21:54.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以决斗冠军为目标努力！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.96,0:21:56.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那玩意儿是你的。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.96,0:22:02.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞，拿到一个了！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.96,0:22:04.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就照这个势头，下一场也要赢！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.96,0:22:07.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管什么样的对手都放马过来！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.39,0:22:08.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天，我！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.96,0:24:12.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏力超群的怪兽效果超强！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.96,0:24:20.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用霍普剑斩把一切统统砍倒！

